"entity": {
"name": "Element Solutions Inc",
"description": "Element Solutions, Inc. is a specialty chemicals company, which engages in providing technology, chemical products, and technical services. It operates through the Electronics and Specialty segments. The Electronics segment focuses on researching, formulating, and sale of specialty chemicals and material process technologies for all types of electronics hardware, from printed circuit board designs to semiconductor packaging. The Specialty segment is involved in the researching, formulating, and sale of specialty chemicals and material process technologies that enhance surfaces and improve industrial processes in diverse industrial sectors from automotive trim to transcontinental infrastructure and from high-speed printing to high-design faucets. The company was founded by Martin Ellis Franklin on April 23, 2013 and is headquartered in Miami Beach, FL.",
